+/**
+ * Builds the RFC 9457 problem details object for an error.
+ *
+ * `body` members come first, so the reserved members win over them. Unhandled errors expose only
+ * `type` (always `about:blank`, since a plain `Error` may carry an arbitrary `type`), `title` and
